- Recovery time.
- Failure rate.
- Test coverage.
- Regression frequency.
- Deployment success rate.

12.7 Independence

- Percentage of critical services self-hosted.
- Number of replaceable external dependencies.
- Number of independently executable services.
- Data portability.
- Model portability.
- Infrastructure control.

Targets must be established from measured baselines rather than invented in advance.

