Critical services can be monitored, maintained, backed up, recovered, and deployed through documented processes.

15.7 Global Accessibility

The platform supports international users and progressively expands language and product capabilities.

15.8 Long-Term Ownership

XSUS has increasing control over its software, data, intelligence infrastructure, and critical technology.

